    "predictor": "No rule is hand-written per domain. Each field's rule is SEARCHED over a small generic hypothesis space (constant / minimum-description-length lookup on any visible scalar / string affix-rewrite / verbatim observation-field copy / structural anti-unification template whose scalar holes are filled by verbatim copy, learned affix rewrite, learned two-source string join, or -- Tier C only -- one unary or binary integer operation over two visible numbers), FITTED on the 580 train examples only, then EVALUATED on the untouched 96 held-out examples.",
